        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Fix AVC profile table values]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44315</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44315"/>
        <updated>2026-06-01T08:55:04.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33368817?u=80d39153e27b7d191281ed9b12cfb2b414418080&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>
<p dir="auto">Correct two AVC profile table entries in the <code class="notranslate">codecs</code> parameter guide:</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>CAVLC 4:4:4 Intra Profile uses profile number <code class="notranslate">2C</code> and constraints byte <code class="notranslate">10</code>.</li>
<li>Scalable High Intra Profile uses constraints byte <code class="notranslate">10</code>.</li>
</ul>
<h3 dir="auto">Motivation</h3>
<p dir="auto"><span class="issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se" aria-label="This pull request closes issue #44246.">Fixes</span> <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4517096701" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44246" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/44246/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44246">#44246</a>.<br>
<span class="issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se" aria-label="This pull request closes issue #44247.">Fixes</span> <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4517144174" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44247" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/44247/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44247">#44247</a>.</p>
<p dir="auto">The IANA <code class="notranslate">video/H264</code> registration lists <code class="notranslate">C44I</code> as profile <code class="notranslate">2C</code> with <code class="notranslate">profile-iop</code> value <code class="notranslate">00010000</code>, which maps to constraints byte <code class="notranslate">10</code>. The IANA <code class="notranslate">video/H264-SVC</code> registration lists <code class="notranslate">SHI</code> as profile <code class="notranslate">56</code> with <code class="notranslate">profile-iop</code> value <code class="notranslate">0x010000</code>, which also maps to constraints byte <code class="notranslate">10</code>.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Additional details</h3>
<p dir="auto">References:</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li><a href="https://www.iana.org/assignments/media-types/video/H264" rel="nofollow">https://www.iana.org/assignments/media-types/video/H264</a></li>
<li><a href="https://www.iana.org/assignments/media-types/video/H264-SVC" rel="nofollow">https://www.iana.org/assignments/media-types/video/H264-SVC</a></li>
</ul>
<h3 dir="auto">Related issues and pull requests</h3>
