        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Rectify rules for attribute inheritance from <g>]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44306</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44306"/>
        <updated>2026-05-30T19:03:22.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44340603?u=5f2c3fba74e811aa8a011ad1126a6deadc56d170&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>
<p dir="auto">Rectifies that all attributes are not inherited : first, non-presentation attributes (such as id or class) are not inherited, second, some presentation attributes that are specific to some SVG elements will be ignored on &lt;g&gt;.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Motivation</h3>
<p dir="auto">I was blocked several times wondering why my g elements refused to work with some attributes and not others.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Additional details</h3>
<p dir="auto"><a href="https://svgwg.org/svg2-draft/styling.html#TermPresentationAttribute" rel="nofollow">https://svgwg.org/svg2-draft/styling.html#TermPresentationAttribute</a></p>
<p dir="auto">See also the linked issue.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Related issues and pull requests</h3>
<p dir="auto"><span class="issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se" aria-label="This pull request closes issue #44288.">fixes</span> <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4544731045" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44288" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/44288/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44288">#44288</a></p>]]></content>
